      "app": "Robinhood",
      "caption": "Robinhood just updated its policy. Updated July 22, 2026.\n\n- Robinhood Platinum Credit Card now listed as a covered product\n- Credit card usage data likely collected under existing policy terms\n- Expanded product scope may mean more financial data sharing with partners\n\nOnly a new product name was added to the policy scope. No changes to data use, sharing, or user rights detected.\n\nWhat you can do:\n- Review what data Robinhood collects for credit card products\n- Check if you hold or plan to get the Platinum Credit Card\n- Visit Robinhood's privacy policy page for full data-sharing details\n\n#Robinhood #privacy #termsofservice #dataprivacy #tosmonitor",
