      "app": "Snapchat",
      "caption": "Snapchat just updated its policy. Effective 21 September 2026.\n\n- Snapchat may now scan faces in your Memories for grouping and search features.\n- Snap can infer or verify your age from content and activity you provide.\n- Automated tools now explicitly scan content to detect policy violations and check age.\n- AI Features section clarified: your My AI chats help train Snap's AI models.\n\nNew face-grouping data use and age-inference language are meaningful expansions of how Snap processes your personal content.\n\nWhat you can do:\n- Check Memories settings and disable face grouping features if unwanted.\n- Review My AI chat history and delete anything you don't want used for training.\n- Visit Snapchat's Privacy Center to audit what data Snap holds about you.\n\n#Snapchat #privacy #termsofservice #dataprivacy #tosmonitor",
