    {
      "app": "Steam",
      "caption": "Steam recently updated its Privacy Policy to swap out its EU data-protection representative. The old representative, Valve GmbH i.L., has been replaced by RIVACY GmbH, located at Mexikoring 33, 22297 Hamburg, Germany. For most users this changes nothing about how Steam collects, uses, or shares your data. However, if you are an EU resident who needs to submit a data-access, correction, or deletion request under GDPR, you should make sure you are directing those inquiries to the new representative. Check Steam's current privacy policy for the updated contact before sending any formal requests.\n\n#Steam #valve #privacypolicy #GDPR #gamingprivacy #dataprotection #EUprivacy #privacy",
